00:19:33,352 --> 00:19:37,532
Three: electronic cams run by shaft angle,

240
00:19:37,552 --> 00:19:42,532
and look-ahead slows down early for slow stitches.

241
00:19:42,932 --> 00:19:48,260
The assignment, quiz and both lab reports are on WenQuest.

242
00:19:48,660 --> 00:19:51,561
The slides, the virtual labs,

243
00:19:51,581 --> 00:19:58,611
the assignment and the quiz are all on the WenQuest learning platform,

244
00:19:58,631 --> 00:20:05,359
at learn.wenquestrobotics.com. Sign up for free and start learning.

245
00:20:05,759 --> 00:20:09,275
Next time it's computerised embroidery machines.

246
00:20:09,295 --> 00:20:12,075
Again an X–Y frame carries the fabric,

247
00:20:12,095 --> 00:20:17,233
but one machine may have anywhere from a few heads to a dozen or more,

248
00:20:17,253 --> 00:20:22,538
